  style: {
    stroke: "#0D47A1"
    stroke-width: 2
    stroke-dash: 4
  }
  tooltip: "ID: canonicalizer_to_artifacts\nRelationship: writes\nContract: artifact metadata and bytes\nAuthentication: scoped artifact-store credential\nMode: sync\nTimeout: 30s\nRetries: bounded retry\nIdempotency: artifact_sha256\nFallback: retain metadata as unavailable\nFailure propagation: event is partial and cannot satisfy raw-artifact requirement\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/agent-provenance-ledger-and-codex-feedback.md:1#Agent Provenance Ledger and Codex Feedback Plan @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; intended/design_document: docs/architecture-diagrams.md:1#Tabellio System Architecture Diagrams @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca"
}

