  }
  tooltip: "ID: projector_reads_ledger\nRelationship: reads\nContract: ledger event and relationship schema\nAuthentication: read-only database credential\nMode: sync\nTimeout: 10s\nRetries: one retry\nIdempotency: projection_revision plus event_id\nFallback: retry projection later\nFailure propagation: read model lags\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/agent-provenance-ledger-and-codex-feedback.md:1#Agent Provenance Ledger and Codex Feedback Plan @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; intended/external_document: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/queries-with.html @ PostgreSQL 18 current documentation"
